Package: epiCore
Type: Package
Title: Unified Data Contract Foundation for Infectious Disease Surveillance Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("EpiStack", "Authors", email = "epistack@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: EpiStack Authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: EpiStack Authors <epistack@example.com>
Description: Dependency-free foundation layer (L0) of the EpiStack ecosystem.
    Defines the versioned surveillance data contract, region code normalization,
    spatial adjacency weight construction, count ingestion and quality control.
    All downstream layers (alerting, spatial modelling, inequity measurement,
    reporting) consume the same long table, so a layer can be replaced without
    breaking the pipeline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
NeedsCompilation: no
